					<ul class='relations-doc'>
	<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-282"><a up-transition='cross-fade' up-target='#unpoly-content' href="https://sovacapital.com/service/capital-markets/">Capital Markets</a></li>
	<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-283"><a up-transition='cross-fade' up-target='#unpoly-content' href="https://sovacapital.com/service/capital-markets-origination/">Capital Markets Origination</a></li>
	<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-289"><a up-transition='cross-fade' up-target='#unpoly-content' href="https://sovacapital.com/service/prime-services/">Prime Services</a></li>
	<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service current-menu-item menu-item-285"><a up-transition='cross-fade' up-target='#unpoly-content' href="https://sovacapital.com/service/global-securities-financing/" aria-current="page">Global Securities Financing</a></li>
	<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-286"><a up-transition='cross-fade' up-target='#unpoly-content' href="https://sovacapital.com/service/research/">Research</a></li>
</ul>					<h3 class="-smallH">Global Securities Financing</h3>
					
										
										<p><p>Sova Capital offers its clients a wide range of global securities financing products.  We have well established relationships with a diverse network of counterparties and clients who are active in the global securities lending and borrowing markets.  This enables us to offer unparalleled access to inventory and provide an excellent service to both those seeking coverage for short selling opportunities or requiring funding solutions.</p>
</p>
					<div class="inner">
						<div class="swiper-container">
							<div class="swiper-wrapper">
								


		
		<article class="swiper-slide">
									<img src="https://sovacapital.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/REPO-Treasury_icon_1.svg" alt="$image['alt']"/>
									<p>A wide network of counterparties, liquidity providers and clients worldwide</p>
								</article>
	
		
		<article class="swiper-slide">
									<img src="https://sovacapital.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/REPO-Treasury_icon_2.svg" alt="$image['alt']"/>
									<p>Our clients can choose from a wide range of markets, tenors and structures to meet their needs.</p>
								</article>
	
		
		<article class="swiper-slide">
									<img src="https://sovacapital.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/REPO-Treasury_icon_3.svg" alt="$image['alt']"/>
									<p>Our reach and flexibility to meet specific client requests, both in terms of securing exclusive inventory to facilitate short exposure in markets where shorting is limited and also to provide financing against less liquid assets.
</p>
								</article>
	
		
		<article class="swiper-slide">
									<img src="https://sovacapital.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/REPO-Treasury_icon_4.svg" alt="$image['alt']"/>
									<p>A high level of recall protection helps clients to maintain their positions even in volatile and less liquid market conditions.
</p>
								</article>
	
	



							</div>
						</div>
